WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.793
Oh, hit that freeze.

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:03.044
Oh oh, you got a freeze?

00:00:03.044 --> 00:00:04.379
Wait, is that part of your special

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:05.964
-or you found it?
-Those are the power moves, dawg.

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:06.840
-You don't know about the power moves?
-Oh f***.

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:13.638
So today, uh, Joe and I

00:00:13.638 --> 00:00:15.390
will be playing Twisted Metal: Black™

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:17.267
from 2001 on a PS4.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:19.352
I insisted on it, I like the better graphics.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.604
I was like, "I want it to look worse."

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:23.148
What do you think about that?

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:25.608
Yeah well, that explains a lot on the show. Alright here we go.

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.071
We've come to the Q&amp;A,

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:32.824
where I ask the Qs, or I kick your A.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:34.743
-You've played all the Twisted Metal...
-I did, I did.

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:36.619
-I played 1 through Black™, and uh,
-Wow.

00:00:36.619 --> 00:00:38.580
-it was one of the big co-op games that I think
-Sure.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.790
brought together a lot of people, my friends at least,

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.500
so it has a fond place in my heart.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.419
This is gonna be fun!

00:00:44.419 --> 00:00:45.336
Machete!

00:00:45.336 --> 00:00:47.047
-Who are you, who are you choosing?
-I have chosen Sweet Tooth.

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.466
We gotta talk about the car, 'cause like,

00:00:49.674 --> 00:00:51.968
every car has been an ice cream truck in some form.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:54.220
-Nice chain gun, you know like,
-Yes.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.348
-I think the chain gun is pretty iconic to the car too, I mean...
-Oh, 100%.

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.642
Time to play!

00:00:59.642 --> 00:01:00.852
-You and I are going head to head.
-Yes we are.

00:01:00.852 --> 00:01:02.187
Okay, I'm on, I'm on bottom.

00:01:02.645 --> 00:01:04.272
There was a moment where, uh,

00:01:05.106 --> 00:01:07.776
we're in the sand dunes to shoot some Vegas stuff,

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:12.155
-and the ice cream truck literally almost flips.
-Yep.

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:15.033
You know, putting myself in harm's way is nothing new,

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.743
and uh, I did a lot of my own stunts.

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:18.286
I know there's one terrifying thing that

00:01:18.286 --> 00:01:19.746
I think it was one of the last things that we shot--

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:20.872
Oh my God, yeah yeah yeah.

00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:22.207
But uh, I was up on the hood of the car

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:23.416
and I was pounding on the glass,

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.835
-and then proceeded to smash it in.
-I mean, it was insane.

00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:27.921
And then remembered, with terror, that uh,

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.881
Thomas Haden Church was still in the car.

00:01:29.881 --> 00:01:32.550
-What the f***?
-And I remember I jumped off and opened up the door

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:35.011
and there's Thomas kinda frozen like, shaking his head,

00:01:35.011 --> 00:01:36.429
and I'm, "I'm sorry! I'm sorry!" and he's like,

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:38.181
"Uh, it's alright, it's alright. We're good kid."

00:01:39.557 --> 00:01:41.768
So sick of that f***ing clown!

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.770
Sweet Tooth has always wanted to have fans

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:44.646
and he's always wanted to

00:01:44.646 --> 00:01:46.731
that's what he's kinda wishing for and

00:01:47.357 --> 00:01:49.943
that's kinda what takes him on his journey, really.

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:53.738
Needless to say he had

00:01:54.239 --> 00:01:55.990
some childhood trauma that led him to where he was--

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:57.450
Yeah, exactly, exactly,

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.119
-But uh--
-which is I'm really excited for fans to see.

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:00.787
Oh yeah, yeah. I'm really excited too.

00:02:03.331 --> 00:02:04.582
-Did you get me? Damn!
-I won.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.753
Getting a chance to come in and do Twisted Metal,

00:02:08.753 --> 00:02:10.130
which is an iconic franchise,

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.464
for me as a gamer it's like,

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:13.383
it's weight you gotta carry on your shoulders because,

00:02:13.716 --> 00:02:15.635
you know, you understand how gamers think,

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:17.011
you understand what gamers want so,

00:02:17.011 --> 00:02:18.680
-we wanted to recapture the fun
-Yeah.

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:19.931
of couch co-op, of sitting there

00:02:19.931 --> 00:02:21.850
with your buddies and talking trash and you know,

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:23.393
seeing the hits, "Ah!", and do our best

00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:25.353
to kinda replicate that on the television screen.

00:02:25.353 --> 00:02:26.104
Absolutely.

00:02:28.439 --> 00:02:29.691
You know, I remember seeing your audition

00:02:29.691 --> 00:02:31.276
because when we watched yours, it was like,

00:02:31.276 --> 00:02:32.110
"Oh they're our Sweet Tooth."

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:33.528
There was absolutely no question.

00:02:33.528 --> 00:02:35.697
I don't really know how to feel about that but you know.

00:02:37.073 --> 00:02:38.825
-Ooh ooh, ow ow ow, ooh.
-Ooh!

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:40.326
-That took me down, g*****n!
-Ooh!

00:02:40.618 --> 00:02:41.870
Wow, perfect ten too.

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:43.580
I gotta... was that, was that a trophy?

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:45.248
Yeah you got a trophy. Well done.

00:02:45.248 --> 00:02:46.958
Thank you, you are too kind.

00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:50.712
Joe's wrestling and knowing what he can do physically

00:02:50.712 --> 00:02:52.755
was just like, exactly what we were looking for.

00:02:53.089 --> 00:02:56.426
We have Will Arnett voicing Sweet Tooth, which is amazing.

00:02:56.968 --> 00:02:57.802
Put 'er there!

00:02:58.386 --> 00:02:59.888
Firm grip you got there, Stu.

00:02:59.888 --> 00:03:01.472
Bet you have a lot of fun with that.

00:03:02.098 --> 00:03:04.350
For me, it was a blast to portray a character like this

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:05.852
who's just so off the rails.

00:03:06.394 --> 00:03:07.687
But there definitely wasn't any restrictions

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:08.730
what you're putting out there for Will

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:09.814
because you know that he's gonna match it

00:03:09.814 --> 00:03:10.940
and uh... it's gonna be awesome.

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:11.816
Surprise!

00:03:12.233 --> 00:03:12.984
Ooh!

00:03:15.403 --> 00:03:16.446
He was waiting for the questions.

00:03:17.113 --> 00:03:18.156
He was waiting for the questions!

00:03:18.156 --> 00:03:19.949
-I was like, "why don't you take this one?"
-Yeah yeah yeah,

00:03:19.949 --> 00:03:21.409
"Why don't you take this one Joe?"

00:03:23.411 --> 00:03:25.246
What was it like working with Stephanie and Anthony?

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:28.041
Awesome. You know, you couldn't ask for two better people

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:29.500
uh, you know, especially for

00:03:29.918 --> 00:03:33.880
a uh... a newer actor as myself to work with, I mean

00:03:34.297 --> 00:03:34.964
a lot of fun.

00:03:40.428 --> 00:03:42.263
Some of the fight scenes we had in the casino

00:03:42.263 --> 00:03:45.350
uh... were definitely a lot of fun, especially with Anthony

00:03:45.767 --> 00:03:47.518
and his propensity to uh, throw himself

00:03:47.518 --> 00:03:49.187
on objects and make people think that I'm

00:03:49.395 --> 00:03:51.356
-shoving, tossing him around the room.
-Oh my God, yeah.

00:03:53.274 --> 00:03:54.359
Oh, hi there!

00:03:57.153 --> 00:03:58.655
Aw, that tickled.

00:03:58.655 --> 00:03:59.864
I think all the stuff we shot

00:03:59.864 --> 00:04:01.366
that was supposed to be the Vegas desert

00:04:01.866 --> 00:04:03.993
was really fun. I mean, it was really hot. It was--

00:04:03.993 --> 00:04:07.622
Oh no, oh no! Awwww, well done!

00:04:07.997 --> 00:04:10.500
Take the question kid! Take those questions!

00:04:10.833 --> 00:04:11.668
Damn it!

00:04:15.129 --> 00:04:16.339
DAAAAAAMN!

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.008
OHHHHH NOOOOO!

00:04:19.801 --> 00:04:21.386
OHHHHHHHHH!

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:25.932
-Good game.
-Damn.

00:04:26.474 --> 00:04:28.142
-You got me, you got me that last time.
-Yeah. I got one, yeah.

00:04:28.142 --> 00:04:30.603
-That was a pretty good move.
-I just had to trap you against that building.

